  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-no-touch-fish-v2.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "5e92a7f3f5aabd588d9dbd444ef61854f48e955131211100bd0d64c1db5d5812",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "685eb5e444ad697ddeaf2ed88c04d8dcedb2a5b6a368a6331fd04bf44ea038ea",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nNo-Touch Fish",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "393049fcacb45385f048b7bd01791ccaaeb6a1aa4d01ad3cda90ce10142f483c",
      "text": "Sandy brings a game to Iron\nFan’s yard.\nIt is a paper river with a\npaper bridge.\nA red paper fish sits in\nthe river.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "af0cd89b423226757c0c89c9a2e939666e99fc8640024b5a617e4d162aaab3a5",
      "text": "Wukong looks closer.\nThe fish moves! Nobody is\ntouching it.\nIt swims toward the bridge.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d4f73c9d973bb6f50fe9a6066e906b3ce6c88022a88ce0b6419bf238bbec3a51",
      "text": "“Iron Fan!” says Wukong.\n“You are blowing it with\nyour fan!”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8d8be1c2e3dcf0bf080b5ee7a723204f6e972174ab672e38f00926acbd94c088",
      "text": "Iron Fan holds up her fan. It\nis not moving.\nBut the fish swims under\nthe bridge!\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9f8d3108e4c95a95283c13341c53f05713a0473cab6b6b5d60fa2b12089ab1c3",
      "text": "Sandy laughs.\nHis hand comes out from\nunderneath the board.\nHe is holding a magnet!\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ad983c34c5c5a43adaf369e9cc5883d0a04b7996b2ba0e2c25d172d301191829",
      "text": "“Can a magnet pull paper?”\nasks Wukong.\n“Let’s test some materials,”\nsays Sandy.\nWood, plastic, aluminum\nand steel.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3c26ad0b818101f35a2f94be17fb40d3b96e429f8d8fca3d9edfd7b6bc3bfe0e",
      "text": "The magnet touches the\nwood. Nothing.\nIt touches the plastic.\nNothing again.\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5df605f325a9a04bb0dd35b5296ec434640eadf9df18f26780b1bb1250a9bd58",
      "text": "Iron Fan tries the\nshiny aluminum.\n“It is metal. It will stick!”\nBut it does not stick.\nNot all metal sticks to\na magnet.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5eac0ad8222407f8b4e3141ef5fd3e9d552af1e272ab9e6251a65631fd52fa64",
      "text": "Last, they test the steel.\nClick! It jumps onto\nthe magnet.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c4058cb93a96c0c49b2fac91176bf5ee0e8b53d9caf200723502ce6d23b7e205",
      "text": "“Is there steel in the fish?”\nasks Wukong.\nSandy opens a little pocket in\nthe fish.\nYes! A small piece of steel\nis inside.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "10a5a3cda98fb1cf19ba84edcf31fce6a356ed414bd2e0e8283f51afb472ed6f",
      "text": "Sandy moves the magnet\nunderneath the board.\nThe magnet pulls the steel\nthrough the paper.\nSo the fish swims!\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "43d9ee49d931ab34f13ff9ddea9160a30a49449629800508f504678ed0bab2c6",
      "text": "Wukong cuts his own\npaper fish.\nHe moves the\nmagnet underneath.\nHis fish does not move at all.\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0a3d7c7a6997d8981310cdbca7ace7ab6ab57d1d381a0c473076cad799cd339a",
      "text": "“Please swim?” Wukong asks\nit nicely.\nThe fish stays still.\nIron Fan giggles behind\nher fan.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c9b1ebc4a2a1c8ebb30a0d610bd2691b5a7b672b613372d2ea5a8dba13f5855b",
      "text": "Iron Fan gives him the\nsteel piece.\nThey tape it inside his fish.\nNow Wukong’s fish swims too!\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "02f5bcf1a48cc4175e267920225546631593af00c5d701d2e9b15c9827a68124",
      "text": "One by one, the fish swim\nunder the bridge.\nThey swim all the way to the\npaper pond.\n“Thank you, magnet!”\nsays Wukong.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
